{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06401","headline":"少室雪晴送王宁 · 李颀","name":"少室雪晴送王宁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少室衆峯几峰别，一峰晴见一峰雪。\n隔城半山连青松，素色峨峨千万重。\n过景斜临不可道，白云欲尽难爲容。\n行人与我翫幽境，北风切切吹衣冷。\n惜别浮桥驻马时，举头试望南山岭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06401.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06401","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}